# T-1618: Annotation::Annotated with a PropertyDict as outer — chained annotation.
# x@[doc: "help"]@Inner in dict key position uses
# Annotated(Box<Annotation>, Box<Annotation>) with a non-Simple outer.
# This test verifies that the chained annotation evaluates without error and
# the enclosed value is accessible normally.
[
  x@[doc: "help"]@Inner: 42
  result: [= x 42]
]
=== out
Dict({"x": Int(42), "result": Variant(Boolean.True, Null)})
